      "allow_dynamic": true,
      "description": "Operator layer: project discovery, the per-user home, approvals, rendering and the release handoff. It reaches the companion, version control and repository hosting only through the Companion, VersionControl and RepositoryHosting ports (xorchestrate.ports), whose adapters live under xorchestrate.adapters and are selected by name from the user's home. It hands composition an explicit ProjectContext; composition and the core never import it."
